      "id": "0e721998-9da9-462e-88c4-bfdc4eeceb62",
      "name": "Customer certificates",
      "description": {
        "content": "A sales tax exemption certificate documents the exemption claimed by a purchaser\nto legally make a tax-free purchase.\nCertificates can be uploaded to Anrok via the Anrok UI as well as via the API.\nSee our\n<a href=\"https://help-center.anrok.com/hc/en-us/articles/24861687025299-Upload-an-exemption-certificate\">Help Center article</a>\nfor more information.\n",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
